# Repository Agent Contract

Before substantial work, run `scripts/preflight.sh` and stop on `PREFLIGHT_BLOCK`.

- The remote default branch is the source of truth. Discover it; do not assume `main`.
- Search before creating. Order: reuse, extend, refactor, then create.
- Respect `.cursor/governance.json`. Do not bypass hooks.
- Keep one workstream on the current branch. No unrelated refactors.
- No migration, recording, or deployment demo unless the change requires it and the user asked.
- Read targeted ranges. Use search and `git diff` before opening large files.
- Do not load `node_modules`, build output, virtualenvs, or full logs.
- Update `.cursor/context/PROJECT_STATE.md` only when project status materially changes.
- Full policy: `~/.cursor/governance/POLICY.md`.

